load @term/form/code/vibe/mesh
  find mesh

load @term/form/code/vibe/dock
  find dock

load @term/form/code/vibe/site
  find site

load @term/form/code/vibe/tone
  find tone

load @term/form/code/vibe/lean
  find lean

load @term/form/code/vibe/knit
  find knit

load @term/form/code/vibe/wake
  find wake

load @term/form/code/vibe/beat
  find beat

# The base of Vibe Theory: the eight elements that make up the whole model, and nothing else. Three give the where, the mesh and its docks and their sites. Two give the what, the tone and its lean. Two give the how, the knit that moves the state and the wake that grows the space. One gives the when, the beat. The keystone is the pinch-point. Reversibility caps the dimension at eight from above, the one-substance demand fixes it at eight from below, the octonions are forced, their rotation gives four-dimensional spacetime and the 24-cell, and the 24-cell is the dock. The base is forced from one premise.
form vibe
  link mesh, like mesh
  link docks, like list, like dock
  link sites, like list, like site
  link tone, like tone
  link lean, like lean
  link knit, like knit
  link wake, like wake
  link beat, like beat
